  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing UI Components**\n\nOkay, I\'m breaking down the UI into modular components. I\'m starting with `src/components/Header.tsx`, which will hold the notification banner, the sticky header with the logo, and the navigation links. The navigation will include links for jerseys, shoes, accessories, and equipment.\n\n\n**Defining UI Components**\n\nI\'ve got the foundational UI components mapped out now. I am focusing on the `Header` component which will integrate the search bar with autocomplete, a wishlist badge, the cart button with a bouncy badge counter, and a mobile slide-out navigation. I\'m also planning the `BottomNavBar` for mobile and a `Footer` that will be identical to the HTML screenshots. After that I have thought out what should be included in the ProductCard.\n\n\n"
