  planner_response {
    response: "I have designed and implemented the **CoreBuy India** high-performance athletic retail store application based on your provided screens:\n\n- **Visual Identity & Design System**: Crafted a high-energy athletic aesthetic featuring the brand crimson palette (`#b02f00`), Montserrat display typography, Inter body styling, and neutral product backdrops.\n- **Home & Discovery**:\n  - **Dynamic Hero Banner**: Features the *\"Unleash Your Speed\"* campaign with high-res athlete imagery and instant action buttons.\n  - **Category Rail**: Circular interactive category badges covering Footwear, Apparel, Accessories, Equipment, and Training.\n  - **Trending Gear Grid**: Product cards equipped with discount badges, price strikes in Indian Rupees (\342\202\271), size selectors, and instant Add to Cart states.\n  - **Spotlight Banner & Trust Badges**: Spotlights the CoreBuy Pro AeroTee (50% Off) with 100% Original Products, Delhivery/DTDC express shipping, and secure payment credentials.\n- **Product Detail Screen**:\n  - **Gallery & Video Demo**: Multi-angle product views with a video agility test modal.\n  - **Interactive Size Selector**: Size pills with low-stock badges and an Indian athletic sizing guide.\n  - **Call to Action Suite**: Outlined *\"Add to Cart\"*, solid *\"Buy Now\"*, and a 1-tap *\"Order via WhatsApp\"* integration with pre-filled product details.\n  - **Technical Specifications**: Expandable accordions for Product Description, Fabric & Care instructions, and the 7-Day Replacement Policy.\n- **Delivery & Seamless Checkout**:\n  - **Address Formulation**: Full customer details form with automated Indian Pincode city/state resolution and WhatsApp tracking alerts.\n  - **Interactive Payment Suite**: Order summary with itemized GST breakdown, simulated Razorpay gateway (UPI Apps, QR Code scan, and Credit/Debit cards), and Cash on Delivery.\n  - **Order Confirmation**: Order celebration screen with unique order IDs, Delhivery tracking references, and WhatsApp notification confirmations.\n- **Athlete Account & Live Tracking**:\n  - Visual 4-stage tracking progress bar (Placed \342\206\222 Packed \342\206\222 In Transit \342\206\222 Delivered) and complete order history."
    thinking: "**Verifying Requirements Details**\n\nOkay, I\'ve started going through the requirements, to make sure I understand everything. I\'m focusing on the specifics for app development. I\'ve begun with the need for five distinct screens, which is now implemented, each displaying the header elements, including the logo, search function, and category navigation. I am now looking deeper into the details of each view, particularly the structure of the categories.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have designed and implemented the **CoreBuy India** high-performance athletic retail store application based on your provided screens:\n\n- **Visual Identity & Design System**: Crafted a high-energy athletic aesthetic featuring the brand crimson palette (`#b02f00`), Montserrat display typography, Inter body styling, and neutral product backdrops.\n- **Home & Discovery**:\n  - **Dynamic Hero Banner**: Features the *\"Unleash Your Speed\"* campaign with high-res athlete imagery and instant action buttons.\n  - **Category Rail**: Circular interactive category badges covering Footwear, Apparel, Accessories, Equipment, and Training.\n  - **Trending Gear Grid**: Product cards equipped with discount badges, price strikes in Indian Rupees (\342\202\271), size selectors, and instant Add to Cart states.\n  - **Spotlight Banner & Trust Badges**: Spotlights the CoreBuy Pro AeroTee (50% Off) with 100% Original Products, Delhivery/DTDC express shipping, and secure payment credentials.\n- **Product Detail Screen**:\n  - **Gallery & Video Demo**: Multi-angle product views with a video agility test modal.\n  - **Interactive Size Selector**: Size pills with low-stock badges and an Indian athletic sizing guide.\n  - **Call to Action Suite**: Outlined *\"Add to Cart\"*, solid *\"Buy Now\"*, and a 1-tap *\"Order via WhatsApp\"* integration with pre-filled product details.\n  - **Technical Specifications**: Expandable accordions for Product Description, Fabric & Care instructions, and the 7-Day Replacement Policy.\n- **Delivery & Seamless Checkout**:\n  - **Address Formulation**: Full customer details form with automated Indian Pincode city/state resolution and WhatsApp tracking alerts.\n  - **Interactive Payment Suite**: Order summary with itemized GST breakdown, simulated Razorpay gateway (UPI Apps, QR Code scan, and Credit/Debit cards), and Cash on Delivery.\n  - **Order Confirmation**: Order celebration screen with unique order IDs, Delhivery tracking references, and WhatsApp notification confirmations.\n- **Athlete Account & Live Tracking**:\n  - Visual 4-stage tracking progress bar (Placed \342\206\222 Packed \342\206\222 In Transit \342\206\222 Delivered) and complete order history."
    thinking_duration {
      nanos: 439423495
    }
